<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about__inner">
    <p class="label">Our vision</p>

    <div class="about__pillars">
      <div class="pillar">
        <span class="pillar__word">Clarity.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <span class="pillar__word pillar__word--white">Influence.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <span class="pillar__word">Culture.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about__body">
      <div class="about__text">
        <p>
          CLOUT was built on a simple conviction: that the gap between data and
          instinct is where most brands get lost. We sit in that gap — and we
          work to close it.
        </p>
        <p>
          We blend rigorous analysis with cultural fluency. We read the numbers
          and the room. We find the insight that changes the brief, then build
          the strategy that makes it count.
        </p>
        <p>
          This is intelligence you can feel as much as read. It's the clarity
          that comes from understanding what's really driving behavior — and the
          imagination to know what to do next.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--clout-blue);
    color: white;
    padding: 8rem 3rem 9rem;
  }

  .about__inner {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .about__pillars {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .pillar {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .pillar:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .pillar__word {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    display: block;
  }

  .pillar__word--white {
    color: white;
  }

  .about__body {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .about__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 580px;
  }

  .about__text p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: white;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about {
      padding: 5rem 1.5rem 6rem;
    }
  }
</style>
